ring greater efficiency and compliance.In addition to simplifying the sending and receiving of documents, this solution promotes the elimination of paper and the digitization of document flows, resulting in greater agility and security in transactions.<\/p><p>The automation of these processes contributes to reducing errors, optimizing resources, and complying with legal requirements regarding electronic invoicing and EDI.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4bf4bca e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4bf4bca\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cc163e5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"cc163e5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"740\" height=\"493\" src=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/analista-de-cooperacao-grafico-economia-de-papel-profissional_1418-47.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-13072\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/analista-de-cooperacao-grafico-economia-de-papel-profissional_1418-47.jpg 740w, https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/uploads\/analista-de-cooperacao-grafico-economia-de-papel-profissional_1418-47-300x200